{"id":"vod_lz_57203","vodId":"57203","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"妖怪公寓的幽雅日常","name_cn":"妖怪公寓的幽雅日常","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20230411-1/8c5998e94b6ee5e0fc3e26d46a3df4cd.jpg"},"summary":"稻叶夕士（阿部敦 配音）是刚刚考入了东条商校就读的一年级男生，因为童年时代的不幸遭遇，稻叶一直以来都寄宿在亲戚的家中，过着寄人篱下的生活。如今，考上了寄宿制的高中，稻叶对未来自由的生活充满了憧憬。　　稻叶搬进了名为寿庄的公寓里，让他没有想到的是，这并不是一间普通的公寓，而是妖怪和人类混居的妖怪公寓，稻叶的房东，就是一只外表如同黑色企鹅一般的妖怪。克服了刚开始的恐惧心理，稻叶开始了和妖怪们的同居生活，随着时间的推移，稻叶发现这些外表诡异的妖怪们，实际上拥有着善良的内心。它们的存在渐渐治愈了稻叶心中的伤痕。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-04-11 23:20:03","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230410/7115_06a6b328/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230410/7117_a2e7b2bc/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230410/7114_b82b263e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230410/7116_bdf29324/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230410/7118_02a33c42/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230410/7119_d39e07c9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230410/7127_8572505a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230410/7120_a5783809/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230410/7122_5bd78be9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230410/7121_904c23b6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230410/7123_69337f09/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230410/7124_5b1eddd2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230410/7125_cadb62ea/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230410/7126_8071df33/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20